    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 84"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Longing for the Temple Worship."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the music director; on the Gittith. A Psalm of the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How lovely are Your dwelling places,",
          "Lord of armies!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My soul longed and even yearned for the courtyards of the Lord;",
          "My heart and my flesh sing for joy to the living God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The bird also has found a house,",
          "And the swallow a nest for herself, where she may put her young:",
          "Your altars, Lord of armies,",
          "My King and my God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Blessed are those who dwell in Your house!",
          "They are ever praising You."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Blessed is the person whose strength is in You,",
          "In whose heart are the roads to Zion!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Passing through the Valley of Baca they make it a spring;",
          "The early rain also covers it with blessings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They go from strength to strength,",
          "Every one of them appears before God in Zion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Lord God of armies, hear my prayer;",
          "Listen, God of Jacob!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "See our shield, God,",
          "And look at the face of Your anointed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For a day in Your courtyards is better than a thousand elsewhere.",
          "I would rather stand at the threshold of the house of my God",
          "Than live in the tents of wickedness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the Lord God is a sun and shield;",
          "The Lord gives grace and glory;",
          "He withholds no good thing from those who walk with integrity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord of armies,",
          "Blessed is the person who trusts in You!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
